Z||000003||Fformula88||08-04-2000||06:28 PM||||On the main page, they have a disclaimer stating that they obtained their info from Road and Track, Car and Driver, and Motor Trend magazines.  Each car will have a different time depending on the weather conditions (wind, temp), altitude, milage on engine etc etc that it was tested.  So the difference in the GT's could simply be a result of two different sets of testing conditions.  Also, don't forget the 88's had a little less HP from new emissions requirements.||||reg||1
